### Improvements

- Decorate FlagAccessCheck and UnFlagAccessCheck services in order to provide extra access check logic for group flags;
- Improve EICGroupHeaderBlock class in order to show/hide group flags depending on the access (the acces check was not being triggered);
- Decorate RequestAccessCheck service in order to provide extra access check logic for group flags "request delete" and "request archival".

